This repository contains extensions derived from PopClip-Extensions
(https://github.com/pilotmoon/PopClip-Extensions), pinned at commit
ea2225b8c4cd9c89411b4b292da753b9fdbbd99d, used under the MIT License reproduced below.

Derived extensions (under extensions/<shortcode>/ext/):
  - uppercase     <- source/Uppercase.popclipext
  - lowercase     <- source/Lowercase.popclipext
  - sentence-case <- source/SentenceCase.popclipext
  - url-encode    <- source/URLEncode.popclipext
  - reverse       <- source/Reverse.popclipext

Seliq is PopClip-compatible but is not affiliated with or endorsed by PopClip or Pilotmoon.

